m/world/us/this-building-alone-has-500-approved-h-1b-applications-trump-official-in-texas-reveals-shocking-reality-no-one-is-opening-doors/articleshow/133158849.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-11T20:47:54+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133158863,imgsize-34540.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Maid of honour shocks bride by playing her old voice memo]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133157750.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Caroline Coady Powell's maid of honour, Anna Cooper, delivered a unique wedding toast. Anna played an old voice memo Caroline sent after meeting her future husband. This recording captured Caroline's initial excitement about Colton Powell, whom she met at a wedding. The viral TikTok video showcased the bride's speechless and emotional reaction to the memo. Their enduring friendship, which began in 2004, made the moment incredibly special.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/relationships/maid-of-honour-plays-brides-old-voice-memo-for-wedding-toast-stunned-bride-says-she-couldnt-believe-it/articleshow/133157750.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/relationships/maid-of-honour-plays-brides-old-voice-memo-for-wedding-toast-stunned-bride-says-she-couldnt-believe-it/articleshow/133157750.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-11T20:15:08+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133158081,imgsize-242008.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Will NYPD cops go to Syria, Lebanon with Zohran Mamdani's wife? Row over Rama Duwaji's travel plan to meet family]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3